</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/dd3ad354-928f-11f1-8c92-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-08-07T111511Z-1629884279-RC2NTMA04DK1-RTRMADP-3-SAUDI-DEFENCE-AGREEMENT.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/dd3ad354-928f-11f1-8c92-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-08-07T111511Z-1629884279-RC2NTMA04DK1-RTRMADP-3-SAUDI-DEFENCE-AGREEMENT.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">0fb747fc-9445-11f1-8f9a-3ded2ca21ace</guid><pubDate>Sun, 09 Aug 2026 22:52:55 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/dd3ad354-928f-11f1-8c92-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-08-07T111511Z-1629884279-RC2NTMA04DK1-RTRMADP-3-SAUDI-DEFENCE-AGREEMENT.jpg">via REUTERS - Murat Cetinmuhurdar/PPO</source><dc:creator>安德烈</dc:creator></item><item><category>中国</category><title>周日体育：横滨WTT冠军赛 日本张本兄妹双双登顶</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD/20260809-%E5%91%A8%E6%97%A5%E4%BD%93%E8%82%B2-%E6%A8%AA%E6%BB%A8wtt%E5%86%A0%E5%86%9B%E8%B5%9B-%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%AC%E5%BC%A0%E6%9C%AC%E5%85%84%E5%A6%B9%E5%8F%8C%E5%8F%8C%E7%99%BB%E9%A1%B6</link><description>
